spectively. The matrix $[T]_{B|C}$ of the linear map $T:V\\to W$ relative to these bases, and the coordinates of the vector $x\\in V$ relative to $B$ are shown above. Find $[T(x)]_{C}.$" :question/worked-solution "The coordinates of the image of $x$ under $T$ relative to the basis $C$ can be found as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[T(x)]_{C} & =[T]_{B|C}\\cdot [x]_{B} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}7 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 5 \\\\ -9 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 27 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e771c908-8304-5e57-8d4f-100289e40581"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e771c908-8304-5e57-8d4f-100289e40581" :answer-field/id #uuid "e771c908-8304-5e57-8d4f-100289e40581" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-4b1f7903-eae6-588c-9d3f-c176da898dc4" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4b1f7903-eae6-588c-9d3f-c176da898dc4" "answer-fe60b7bf-8270-5ace-8733-c5b5ad6a8aba" "answer-1db76eea-293a-52d5-89d3-bf2e5891b0a7" "answer-03018aeb-40a2-5df3-a468-c9d1f7bc8c68" "answer-c38f2bd7-49e7-569f-a537-32652cd14d29"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4b1f7903-eae6-588c-9d3f-c176da898dc4" :answer/id #uuid "4b1f7903-eae6-588c-9d3f-c176da898dc4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 27 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fe60b7bf-8270-5ace-8733-c5b5ad6a8aba" :answer/id #uuid "fe60b7bf-8270-5ace-8733-c5b5ad6a8aba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 23 \\\\ -8\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1db76eea-293a-52d5-89d3-bf2e5891b0a7" :answer/id #uuid "1db76eea-293a-52d5-89d3-bf2e5891b0a7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ -14\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer