:answer/id #uuid "c738ac4e-c5ca-55f7-8b7e-7ca5fc112779" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }_{1,2}=\\pm 2\\,\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d487fe4a-49a7-570a-8e9b-ee6f1d788128" :answer/id #uuid "d487fe4a-49a7-570a-8e9b-ee6f1d788128" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }_{1,2}=\\pm \\sqrt{3}\\,\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a59f1682-e857-5cb3-b30e-fa735417b601" :answer/id #uuid "a59f1682-e857-5cb3-b30e-fa735417b601" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${\\lambda }_{1}=1$ and ${\\lambda }_{2}=-3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3e9df835-051e-5c40-abe1-9635240b0de0" :answer/id #uuid "3e9df835-051e-5c40-abe1-9635240b0de0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${\\lambda }_{1}=3$ and ${\\lambda }_{2}=-1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6a1bab0c-d263-5a8a-aa46-42456ace7305" :answer-field/id #uuid "6a1bab0c-d263-5a8a-aa46-42456ace7305" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-6e9bcb63-cc9a-5d11-8990-1587763fb06a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-65c000a6-f27e-5742-a956-c3a4d4c78e0a" "answer-28d23768-6e67-5917-bddf-f6c6d0931487" "answer-6e9bcb63-cc9a-5d11-8990-1587763fb06a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-65c000a6-f27e-5742-a956-c3a4d4c78e0a" :answer/id #uuid "65c000a6-f27e-5742-a956-c3a4d4c78e0a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "a stable" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-28d23768-6e67-5917-bddf-f6c6d0931487" :answer/id #uuid "28d23768-6e67-5917-bddf-f6c6d0931487" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "an asymptotically stable" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6e9bcb63-cc9a-5d11-8990-1587763fb06a" :answer/id #uuid "6e9bcb63-cc9a-5d11-8990-1587763fb06a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "an unstable" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-517d7ac2-a9a4-59ba-9ce2-95fdac829b49" :answer-field/id #uuid "517d7ac2-a9a4-59ba-9ce2-95fdac829b49" :answer-field/key "field-7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-3258ffcc-bba5-5887-a061-5c3ced84df51" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f7cd0787-5730-5aa3-825a-947083374f26" "answer-3258ffcc-bba5-5887-a061-5c3ced84df51" "answer-893ea89e-79b4-509b-91fb-2a552004af50" "answer-80865636-0c1f-5d1e-8cc4-8d211a02b4c1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f7cd0787-5730-5aa3-825a-947083374f26" :answer/id #uuid "f7cd0787-5730-5aa3-825a-947083374f26" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "center" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3258ffcc-bba5-5887-a061-5c3ced84df51" :answer/id #uuid "3258ffcc-bba5-5887-a061-5c3ced84df51" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "saddle" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-893ea89e-79b4-509b-91fb-2a552004af50" :answer/id #uuid "893ea89e-79b4-509b-91fb-2a552004af50" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "spiral sink" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-80865636-0c1f-5d1e-8cc4-8d211a02b4c1" :answer/id #uuid "80865636-0c1f-5d1e-8cc4-8d211a02b4c1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "spiral source" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186167261 :question/problem "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}=8x(1-0.75x)-xy \\\\ {y}^{′}=-4y+4xy\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the Lotka-Volterra model with carrying capacity above, where $x=x(t)$ represents the prey and $y=y(t)$ represents the predators. Select the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\n$\\,$ Evaluating the Jacobian of the system at the equilibrium ${x}^{∗}=[1,\\,2]^{T},$ we get\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">$J({x}^{∗})=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\,.$</td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-3}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-4}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n$\\,$ The eigenvalues of the Jacobian matrix are \n{{field-5}}.\n\n$\\,$ Therefore, the equilibrium at ${x}^{∗}$ is \n{{field-6}}{{field-7}}." :question/worked-solution "Let's denote ${f}_{1}(x,y)=8x(1-0.75x)-xy$ and ${f}_{2}(x,y)=-4y+4xy.$\n\nNow, we compute the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂{f}_{1}}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(8x(1-0.75x)-xy)=8-12x-y,\\, & \\frac{∂{f}_{1}}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(8x(1-0.75x)-xy)=-x \\\\ \\frac{∂{f}_{2}}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(-4y+4xy)=4y,\\, & \\frac{∂{f}_{2}}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(-4y+4xy)=-4+4x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the Jacobian matrix is\n\n$$\nJ=[\\begin{aligned}8-12x-y & -x \\\\ 4y & -4+4x\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the Jacobian at the equilibrium ${x}^{∗}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$ to get\n\n$$\nJ({x}^{∗})=[\\begin{aligned}8-12(1)-(2) & -(1) \\\\ 4(2) & -4+4(1)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-6 & -1 \\\\ 8 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo find the eigenvalues of the Jacobian matrix, we write down the characteristic equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}-6-\\lambda  & -1 \\\\ 8 & -\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-6-\\lambda )(-\\lambda )-8(-1) & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+6\\lambda +8 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving the equation, we get the eigenvalues ${\\lambda }_{1}=-2\\text{ and }{\\lambda }_{2}=-4.$ Since both eigenvalues are real and negative, our equilibrium is $\\text{an asymptotically stable}$ $\\text{sink}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ac0b6904-a5d4-574c-9a33-7bc8ba936b06" "answer-field-5f2dccd0-8412-54f0-91d9-df4004e5d40b" "answer-field-8dbe6572-4dcf-5da1-bbdf-9c8211ca4b48"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186164735 :answer-field/correct 17592186164737 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id 17592186164723 :answer-field/correct 17592186164725 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id 17592186164729 :answer-field/correct 17592186164734 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id 17592186164717 :answer-field/correct 17592186164718 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ac0b6904-a5d4-574c-9a33-7bc8ba936b06" :answer-field/id #uuid "ac0b6904-a5d4-574c-9a33-7bc8ba936b06" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-a8625f49-7424-50c0-9f62-a725f5bc506e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-bf250fae-4598-5cc9-89c0-fae9effe9e8f" "answer-3c335abc-7f65-5a71-b647-04573f82b134" "answer-a8625f49-7424-50c0-9f62-a725f5bc506e" "answer-ab3e6485-cbb3-5542-a015-44b4455faf42"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bf250fae-4598-5cc9-89c0-fae9effe9e8f" :answer/id #uuid "bf250fae-4598-5cc9-89c0-fae9effe9e8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }_{1,2}=-1\\pm \\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3c335abc-7f65-5a71-b647-04573f82b134" :answer/id #uuid "3c335abc-7f65-5a71-b647-04573f82b134" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${\\lambda }_{1}=-1$ and ${\\lambda }_{2}=4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a8625f49-7424-50c0-9f62-a725f5bc506e" :answer/id #uuid "a8625f49-7424-50c0-9f62-a725f5bc506e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${\\lambda }_{1}=-2$ and ${\\lambda }_{2}=-4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ab3e6485-cbb3-5542-a015-44b4455faf42" :answer/id #uuid "ab3e6485-cbb3-5542-a015-44b4455faf42" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${\\lambda }_{1}=1$ and ${\\lambda }_{2}=-2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5f2dccd0-8412-54f0-91d9-df4004e5d40b" :answer-field/id #uuid "5f2dccd0-8412-54f0-91d9-df4004e5d40b" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-dbdae340-e522-53dc-8169-2b859fab4960" :answer-field/choices ["answer-841a1348-fe98-5cb0-884d-4b55c300265a" "answer-dbdae340-e522-53dc-8169-2b859fab4960" "answer-a634537e-8f67-5ed7-8f8c-d6fe19ea34ec"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-841a1348-fe98-5cb0-884d-4b55c300265a" :answer/id #uuid "841a1348-fe98-5cb0-884d-4b55c300265a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "a stable" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dbdae340-e522-53dc-8169-2b859fab4960" :answer/id #uuid "dbdae340-e522-53dc-8169-2b859fab4960" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "an asymptotically stable" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a634537e-8f67-5ed7-8f8c-d6fe19ea34ec" :answer/id #uuid "a634537e-8f67-5ed7-8f8c-d6fe19ea34ec" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "an unstable" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8dbe6572-4dcf-5da1-bbdf-9c8211ca4b48" :answer-field/id #uuid "8dbe6572-4dcf-5da1-bbdf-9c8211ca4b48" :answer-field/key "field-7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-2778abd4-0a40-5e97-9f88-65eea12c439a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e445fdc7-ae51-5ba1-876e-db6a3e330b7f" "answer-93969de7-d5b9-5979-8161-739454193bfa" "answer-2778abd4-0a40-5e97-9f88-65eea12c439a" "answer-d21422c7-a7cf-5a82-8bd2-4a64f4618799"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e445fdc7-ae51-5ba1-876e-db6a3e330b7f" :answer/id #uuid "e445fdc7-ae51-5ba1-876e-db6a3e330b7f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "center" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-93969de7-d5b9-5979-8161-739454193bfa" :answer/id #uuid "93969de7-d5b9-5979-8161-739454193bfa" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "saddle" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2778abd4-0a40-5e97-9f88-65eea12c439a" :answer/id #uuid "2778abd4-0a40-5e97-9f88-65eea12c439a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "sink" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d21422c7-a7cf-5a82-8bd2-4a64f4618799" :answer/id #uuid "d21422c7-a7cf-5a82-8bd2-4a64f4618799" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "source" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-bcc29b37-0226-5337-b5dc-f223113388b1" :question/id #uuid "bcc29b37-0226-5337-b5dc-f223113388b1" :question/math-academy-id "q-335667" :question/problem "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}=4x(1-2x)-xy \\\\ {y}^{′}=-3y+3xy\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the Lotka-Volterra model with carrying capacity above, where $x=x(t)$ represents the prey and $y=y(t)$ represents the predators. Select the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\n$\\,$ Evaluating the Jacobian of the system at the equilibrium ${x}^{∗}=[0,\\,0]^{T},$ we get\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">$J({x}^{∗})=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\,.$</td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-3}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-4}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n$\\,$ The eigenvalues of the Jacobian matrix are \n{{field-5}}.\n\n$\\,$ Therefore, the equilibrium at ${x}^{∗}$ is \n{{field-6}}{{field-7}}." :question/worked-solution "Let's denote ${f}_{1}(x,y)=4x(1-2x)-xy$ and ${f}_{2}(x,y)=-3y+3xy.$\n\nNow, we compute the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂{f}_{1}}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(4x(1-2x)-xy)=4-16x-y,\\, & \\frac{∂{f}_{1}}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(4x(1-2x)-xy)=-x \\\\ \\frac{∂{f}_{2}}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(-3y+3xy)=3y,\\, & \\frac{∂{f}_{2}}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(-3y+3xy)=-3+3x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the Jacobian matrix is\n\n$$\nJ=[\\begin{aligned}4-16x-y & -x \\\\ 3y & -3+3x\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the Jacobian at the equilibrium ${x}^{∗}=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$ to get\n\n$$\nJ({x}^{∗})=[\\begin{aligned}4-16(0)-0 & -0 \\\\ 3(0) & -3+3(0)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThe eigenvalues of the Jacobian matrix are ${\\lambda }_{1}=4\\text{ and }{\\lambda }_{2}=-3.$ Since the eigenvalues are real with opposite signs, our equilibrium is $\\text{an unstable}$ $\\text{saddle}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-10cae622-dbd6-5d18-bb11-efc0387b0e13" "answer-field-8c5e67eb-9858-52e1-a1ec-5d64e78616e9" "answer-field-23115ef5-c129-5ad9-9011-0bdb97fa0e1e" "answer-field-5d48c15b-9a10-5b8a-9144-c5adaa14c269" "answer-field-66a76db4-1d00-5c7e-a73e-b0759e4d6242" "answer-field-c1b2fb14-4e4a-5ce1-8aad-66df92907347" "answer-field-cee2ac53-242b-5692-b795-23e6bb3dc61e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-10cae622-dbd6-5d18-bb11-efc0387b0e13" :answer-field/id #uuid "10cae622-dbd6-5d18-bb11-efc0387b0e13" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-76730f05-78fc-5946-b28e-9b94fccea22a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e9d6509b-a3d5-5411-9d42-530125d18b77" "answer-a0bce58f-1675-5d63-8bac-3db3572d4a18" "answer-5aa0eaf8-abbf-5870-93f3-47c7fcc89474" "answer-94731a9e-5608-56b0-b87b-2a36706d451f" "answer-76730f05-78fc-5946-b28e-9b94fccea22a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e9d6509b-a3d5-5411-9d42-530125d18b77" :answer/id #uuid "e9d6509b-a3d5-5411-9d42-530125d18b77" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a0bce58f-1675-5d63-8bac-3db3572d4a18" :answer/id #uuid "a0bce58f-1675-5d63-8bac-3db3572d4a18" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5aa0eaf8-abbf-5870-93f3-47c7fcc89474" :answer/id #uuid "5aa0eaf8-abbf-5870-93f3-47c7fcc89474" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/valid